    <string name="disclaimer_title">Important</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_text">Unofficial app, not affiliated with any aircraft manufacturer or BRP-Rotax. Data come from public sources (EASA TCDS, national data sheets, manufacturer documents, published bulletins) and are a reminder only. The current AFM, AMM, service bulletins and airworthiness directives of your aircraft, and your maintenance organisation, are always binding. Items marked ⚠ have not been confirmed against the manuals.</string>
