    <string name="about">About</string>
    <string name="about_text">Bulletins and contacts are refreshed daily from online lists maintained by the app author (the TOMARK list is checked automatically every day). Maintenance and bulletin reminders arrive as notifications.</string>
    <string name="about_sources" translatable="false">Sources: EASA TCDS (A.606, A.006, A.583, A.412, A.527, A.065, A.439, A.537, A.644, A.598, A.642); DULV / DAeC / Traficom / BMAA data sheets; manufacturer POH/AFM; BRP-Rotax MML-912; TOMARK technical support list; EASA AD 2026-0170; flyrotax.com distributor pages.</string>
